Maintainer: Dusty Turner <dusty.s.turner@gmail.com>
Description: A 'ggplot2' extension for visualizing mathematical functions and
    probability distributions in two-dimensional space. Provides geoms and
    stats for scalar, parametric, and vector-valued functions as well as
    probability density, mass, cumulative distribution, quantile, hazard,
    cumulative hazard, and survival functions, in both theoretical and
    empirical (including Kaplan-Meier) forms, with support for region and
    highest-density-region shading.
